  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Accelerated BioEconomy Development - BIO4 Campus (Phase A)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The BIO4 Campus Project is envisioned as a multi-phased project that will be implemented through a portfolio approach, as it aims to meet two outcomes: (1) to establish the BIO4 Campus and (2) to build the technical capacities of the BIO4 Campus. The support provided to meet Outcome 1 will predominantly be expertise and support for the establishment and capacity building of the BIO4 Campus and its staff, to meet the needs of smooth running of the Campus and provide services to the Campus tenants</narrative>
  </description>
